## DOMAIN 3: SPATIAL LAYOUT, TABLE ARCHITECTURE & UI INVARIANTS
*(Full specifications in [`.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md`](file:///.agents/rules/ui-invariants.md))*
15. UNIVERSAL TABLE ARCHITECTURE & NATIVE TABLE LOCK (STRICT INVARIANT) (/learn): Root `100vh` lock (`overflow: hidden !important;`). Console: `calc(100vh - 60px) !important;`. Native HTML `<table>` elements are strictly `display: table !important`. Vertical scrolling is EXCLUSIVELY on `.table-wrap { overflow-y: auto; }`. Sticky thead at top, sticky tfoot at bottom.
16. PURE DIRECT ENGLISH UI STANDARD (/learn): All UI text, headers, menus, dialogs use direct English. Sole exception: Indonesian vocabulary meaning.
17. SINGLE-RESPONSIBILITY COLUMNS & DOSSIER MODAL ON CLICK (/learn): Strictly 1 metric per column. Student Roster sequence: Level -> Photo -> Gender -> Name -> DOB -> Age -> Education -> Class Exams -> Status. Clicking photo/name opens Dossier Profile modal. Student deletion restricted exclusively to Inactive Students tab.
18. EXCEL-LIKE MASTER EDIT MODE & ZERO INNER CAPSULE (/learn): View mode: clean text, zero inputs. Edit Mode ON: cell and header gridlines turn crisp white. Inputs have transparent background filling cell seamlessly like an Excel spreadsheet without inner capsule.
20. UNIVERSAL LOWER PANEL ARCHITECTURE & 10PX CONTAINER GAP (/learn): Universal 10px container gap. All tables are contained within workspace container. Table footers never enter the lower panel. The 50px Lower Panel (`.workspace-lower-panel`) is docked flush at base reserved for action buttons, search, and KPIs.
21. DYNAMIC COLUMN SIZING, SINGLE-LINE TEXT & ZERO DEAD SPACE INVARIANT (/learn): Tables expand 100% width, dynamic proportional allocation, zero voids, nowrap cells (`white-space: nowrap !important; text-overflow: ellipsis; overflow: hidden;`), Excel vertical dividers (`border-right`).
22. CENTERED LOADING STATES: Spinners strictly centered horizontally and vertically via canonical `getLoadingStateHtml(message)` in direct English.
25. TUTOR'S ROOM 8-TIER TYPOGRAPHIC SCALE & ZERO SUB-11PX INVARIANT (/learn): Font sizes strictly locked to `--tr-font-*` scale. Zero sub-11px text anywhere in Tutor's Room. Data cells weight 500; bold 700/800 for headers only.
31. DYNAMIC COLUMN RESIZING WITH PERSISTENT WIDTH MEMORY (EXCEL-LIKE) (/learn): Column resize handles on `th`, double-click auto-size, localStorage width persistence (`initColumnResize`).

