## DOMAIN 4: AGENT WORKFLOW, IDE HYGIENE & QUALITY VERIFICATION
*(Full protocols in [`.agents/rules/agent-workflow.md`](file:///.agents/rules/agent-workflow.md))*
12. MANDATORY TASK LIST ON PROCEED: Create and pin `tasks.md` in center editor tab the moment a plan is approved before modifying code.
13. MANDATORY PROMPT & TYPO CORRECTION: Inspect user prompt for typos and display `### 🎯 Perbaikan Perintah (Typo Fixed)` before execution.
14. PLAN NAMING STANDARD & REPOSITORY DUAL-WRITE PROTOCOL (/learn): Save in `docs/plans/YYYYMMDD - <Plan Name>.md` and mirror in active brain artifact directory.
19. AUTOMATIC MIDDLE-PANEL TAB HYGIENE & POST-PROCESS FILE CLOSURE (/learn): Only `tasks.md` is pinned. Maximum 3 open editor tabs.
23. MANDATORY BEFORE & AFTER VISUAL SPECIFICATION PROTOCOL (/learn): Any task involving UI layout, Font, Color, or Tables MUST present an explicit 4-column Before & After Comparative Matrix before modifying code.
24. AUTOMATIC COMPACTION ADVISORY TRIGGER & ANTI-YAPPING DISCIPLINE (/learn): AI cannot invoke slash commands autonomously. Conclude response with `/compact all` banner immediately upon milestone completion or $\ge 20$ turns.
27. DOCUMENTATION HYGIENE & ROLLING-WINDOW PROTOCOL (/learn):
    - `docs/CHANGELOG.md`: Strict rolling window of 25 latest phases in ultra-condensed format (~150–200 lines). Older phases flush to `docs/archive/`.
    - `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md`: Single restart point strictly bounded to $\le 120$ lines (~10 KB). Never append historical phase narratives.
    - `tasks.md` vs `docs/TODO.md`: `tasks.md` in root is sole active task board. Never dump completed task checklists into `docs/TODO.md`.
    - `docs/SESSION_LOG.md`: Compact format capped at $\le 4$ lines per session.
